## Naming Conventions

| What | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Models | PascalCase singular | `BoardColumn.php` |
| Controllers | PascalCase + Controller | `BoardController.php` |
| Policies | PascalCase + Policy | `BoardPolicy.php` |
| Migrations | snake_case with timestamp | `create_boards_table.php` |
| Page components | PascalCase | `Pages/Boards/Show.tsx` |
| UI components | kebab-case (shadcn) | `components/ui/dropdown-menu.tsx` |
| Custom components | PascalCase | `components/SearchModal.tsx` |
| Hooks | camelCase with `use` prefix | `hooks/use-mobile.tsx` |
| Routes | dot-notation | `workspaces.projects.boards.show` |
| DB tables | snake_case plural | `board_columns`, `bookmark_items` |
| DB pivots | alphabetical singular | `project_user`, `workspace_user` |

## Creating New Features Checklist

1. **Migration** — Create table with uuid, slug, timestamps, softDeletes
2. **Model** — With fillable, casts, relationships, boot() for uuid/slug
3. **Policy** — Role-based authorization
4. **Controller** — CRUD with inline validation, Inertia responses
5. **Routes** — Named, nested under appropriate middleware group
6. **TypeScript type** — Add interface to `types/index.d.ts`
7. **Page component** — In appropriate `Pages/` subdirectory
8. **Update HandleInertiaRequests** — If data needs to be shared globally
